<title>MEXICO: Televisa 1997 Q1 net loss narrows.</title>
<headline>Televisa 1997 Q1 net loss narrows.</headline>
<dateline>MEXICO CITY 1997-04-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Q1 1997			Q1 1996</p>
<p>     Shr		  n.a.		     n.a.</p>
<p>     Oper Income	149.96 million	     63.17 million</p>
<p>     Net Loss	   197.45 million	     492.55 million</p>
<p>     Revs		 2.680 bln		2.544 bln</p>
<p>     Gross profit     932.46 million	     885.58 million</p>
<p>     Integ fin cost   132.64 million	     238.13 million</p>
<p>	    Int paid    341.74 million	     623.81 million</p>
<p>	    FX loss     75.55 million	gain  3.94 million</p>
<p>	    Int earned  144.21 million	     289.48 million</p>
<p>	    Mon gain    140.44 million     gain  92.26 million</p>
<p>	    NOTE: All figures in Mexican pesos.</p>
<p>	    Full company name is Grupo Televisa SA.</p>
<p>((--Dan Trotta, Mexico City newsroom, +525 728-9507))</p>
</text>
